  "description": "Relational (PostgreSQL and SQL Server) ILeaseStore for OrionBeacon leader election. A single leader row per resource, with acquire-or-renew as one atomic conditional upsert (INSERT ... ON CONFLICT ... RETURNING on Postgres, MERGE ... OUTPUT on SQL Server), so two candidates can never both acquire and the fencing token strictly increases across every leadership change.",
